Just give Marie back!

277
00:13:27,060 --> 00:13:31,500
Now then, Marks, if you would show them my memories, please.

278
00:13:32,140 --> 00:13:33,380
All right, I will.

279
00:13:39,300 --> 00:13:42,060
In a few moments, my innocence will be proven,

280
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:45,340
and then you will pay severely for the way you've insulted me.

281
00:13:45,340 --> 00:13:57,300
It's clear from his memories.

282
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:59,580
He knew nothing about any of this.

283
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:04,120
So obviously, I couldn't possibly have been involved in the situation.

284
00:14:04,900 --> 00:14:08,880
Not only did you attack me, but you also accused me of a heinous crime.

285
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:11,900
I hope you're prepared to assume full responsibility.

286
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:13,560
Fine.

287
00:14:13,880 --> 00:14:15,400
Do whatever you want to me.

288
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:18,960
But it'll have to wait until Marie gets back safe.

289
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:22,580
What makes you think you have any right to negotiate?

290
00:14:22,580 --> 00:14:28,740
Hold on now.

291
00:14:30,800 --> 00:14:32,920
The guy we saw in your memories.

292
00:14:33,740 --> 00:14:35,600
You know, the one you were arguing with?

293
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:38,860
You think he would have popped in during all this ruckus.

294
00:14:38,860 --> 00:14:44,500
I'm here, sir.

295
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:46,260
Is something wrong?

296
00:14:47,140 --> 00:14:48,640
I'm sorry to interrupt you all,

297
00:14:48,820 --> 00:14:51,100
but there's something I need Yami and his group to see.

298
00:14:51,900 --> 00:14:53,440
Listen, we're a little busy.

299
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:54,920
He should be arriving any moment.

300
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:56,660
Pardon me.

301
00:14:56,660 --> 00:15:02,760
It's my brother.

302
00:15:07,380 --> 00:15:10,320
Remember, at the start of this mess,

303
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:12,740
we put a special communication bracelet on Asta

304
00:15:12,740 --> 00:15:14,900
to keep track of his location at all times.

305
00:15:14,900 --> 00:15:18,300
We're getting a signal from the town of Tu Liu in the Common Realm.

306
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:20,200
What does that mean?

307
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:22,680
Do you think somebody might have taken it off?

308
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:25,300
The only ones who even knew about that bracelet

309
00:15:25,300 --> 00:15:27,480
are the people who were in the room when we did it.

310
00:15:28,100 --> 00:15:29,460
And the only person I could think of

311
00:15:29,460 --> 00:15:30,780
who'd be able to get that thing off

312
00:15:30,780 --> 00:15:32,660
would be Nero with her sealing magic.

313
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:34,540
Perhaps she did remove it,

314
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:36,060
and now she's trying to use the signal

315
00:15:36,060 --> 00:15:37,840
to broadcast her whereabouts to us.

316
00:15:38,300 --> 00:15:40,920
And I bet if we find her, we'll find Marie.

317
00:15:41,220 --> 00:15:41,500
Finral!

318
00:15:41,500 --> 00:15:41,700
Finral!

319
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:42,620
Let's go!

320
00:15:44,460 --> 00:15:46,460
Yeah, so I hate to tell you this,

321
00:15:46,540 --> 00:15:48,160
but I've never actually been to Tu Liu.

322
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:51,760
Guess we'll just have to travel there by broom, then.

323
00:15:51,980 --> 00:15:52,340
Captain.

324
00:15:52,340 --> 00:15:55,300
Allow me to accompany you.

325
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:58,900
After all, my best friend's sister is basically my sister.

326
00:15:59,220 --> 00:15:59,740
Hell no!

327
00:15:59,980 --> 00:16:01,460
Say that again and you're dead!

328
00:16:02,040 --> 00:16:03,300
This may be a trap.

329
00:16:03,500 --> 00:16:04,760
Should we really take that risk?

330
00:16:04,920 --> 00:16:06,540
No one asked you, fungus head!

331
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:08,880
I don't care if it is a trap!

332
00:16:09,040 --> 00:16:11,280
It's the only clue we have to go on right now!

333
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:14,380
I agree with Ghosh.

334
00:16:14,620 --> 00:16:15,780
We gotta check it out.

335
00:16:16,380 --> 00:16:17,120
Hold on.

336
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:20,540
I haven't finished my conversation

337
00:16:20,540 --> 00:16:22,660
with this insufferable criminal yet.

338
00:16:23,180 --> 00:16:23,700
Oh yeah?

339
00:16:24,060 --> 00:16:25,980
Get your head out of your ass!

340
00:16:26,220 --> 00:16:28,360
There's more important stuff going on here!

341
00:16:28,900 --> 00:16:29,260
Yami?

342
00:16:29,800 --> 00:16:32,120
Did I or did I not order the Black Bulls

343
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,120
to keep an eye on Nero?

344
00:16:33,980 --> 00:16:34,740
You did.

345
00:16:35,740 --> 00:16:37,660
They're called the Devil Banishers, yes?

346
00:16:39,340 --> 00:16:41,360
Well, you can't exactly watch over her

347
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:43,000
until you get her back from them, can you?

348
00:16:44,380 --> 00:16:45,580
So, Damnatio,

349
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:47,940
I'll have to ask you to withhold your judgment

350
00:16:47,940 --> 00:16:48,960
for a while longer.

351
00:16:49,280 --> 00:16:50,040
Is that all right?

352
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:51,540
Yes, I suppose so.

353
00:16:52,380 --> 00:16:53,780
I'm counting on you, Yami.

354
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:54,760
Right.

355
00:16:55,540 --> 00:16:57,100
Oh yes, and there's one more thing.

356
00:16:57,540 --> 00:16:59,300
We don't have all day here.

357
00:16:59,300 --> 00:17:01,400
I understand tensions are high

358
00:17:01,400 --> 00:17:03,360
since one of your own has been abducted.

359
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:04,320
But remember,

360
00:17:04,820 --> 00:17:06,080
this isn't like what happened

361
00:17:06,080 --> 00:17:07,080
with the Magic Parliament.

362
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:09,800
With this many unknowns,

363
00:17:10,220 --> 00:17:12,020
one wrong move could put your squad

364
00:17:12,020 --> 00:17:13,020
in grave peril.

365
00:17:20,020 --> 00:17:21,680
No need to tell me.

366
00:17:23,220 --> 00:17:24,260
Enough talk.

367
00:17:24,700 --> 00:17:25,020
Ready?

368
00:17:25,360 --> 00:17:25,920
Let's go!

369
00:17:26,660 --> 00:17:27,240
Yes, sir!

370
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:29,380
I'll go with you.

371
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:32,540
Didn't see that coming.

372
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,160
Why are you taking the time

373
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:41,880
to help us out

374
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:43,440
when your squad's so busy training?

375
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:45,260
We need every magic knight

376
00:17:45,260 --> 00:17:45,820
in the kingdom

377
00:17:45,820 --> 00:17:46,940
to help defeat the evil,

378
00:17:47,060 --> 00:17:48,260
and I don't want to lose anyone

379
00:17:48,260 --> 00:17:49,340
between now and then.

380
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:51,080
No more, no less.

381
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:53,040
Come on, we all know

382
00:17:53,040 --> 00:17:54,660
you're just worried about your sister.

383
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:57,220
Stop trying to act like Mr. Badass.

384
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:58,100
It's getting old.

385
00:17:58,500 --> 00:17:59,920
If you say one more word,

386
00:17:59,980 --> 00:18:00,740
then I won't hesitate

387
00:18:00,740 --> 00:18:01,760
to send you plummeting

388
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:02,780
to your death, foreigner.

389
00:18:03,520 --> 00:18:05,300
So much for that fancy speech

390
00:18:05,300 --> 00:18:06,940
about not wanting to lose anyone.

391
00:18:10,020 --> 00:18:11,000
There it is.

392
00:18:19,300 --> 00:18:20,360
It's destroyed.

393
00:18:20,360 --> 00:18:22,700
It's probably one of the many areas

394
00:18:22,700 --> 00:18:23,320
that were attacked

395
00:18:23,320 --> 00:18:24,820
by the Eye of the Midnight Sun.

396
00:18:30,660 --> 00:18:32,200
I'll be right there, Marie.

397
00:18:35,700 --> 00:18:36,540
The signal.

398
00:18:37,200 --> 00:18:38,100
Yeah, where is it?

399
00:18:38,100 --> 00:18:46,080
I'm guessing that's another magic item

400
00:18:46,080 --> 00:18:47,240
that prevents mana tracking

401
00:18:47,240 --> 00:18:48,260
like the one I have.

402
00:18:48,480 --> 00:18:49,680
Yes, just to be safe.

403
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:51,300
I doubt anyone will find us

404
00:18:51,300 --> 00:18:52,060
way out here,

405
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,280
but it doesn't hurt.

406
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:59,100
It appears they're doing their best

407
00:18:59,100 --> 00:19:00,180
to block the signal.

408
00:19:01,020 --> 00:19:02,220
Do you think they know

409
00:19:02,220 --> 00:19:03,000
about the bracelet?

410
00:19:03,560 --> 00:19:04,360
It's possible.

411
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:05,720
Either way,

412
00:19:05,820 --> 00:19:06,480
we'll be wise

413
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:07,500
to proceed with caution.

414
00:19:12,300 --> 00:19:14,060
Did we really have to land

415
00:19:14,060 --> 00:19:15,320
this far away from them?

416
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:16,680
Are you stupid?

417
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:19,260
I doubt it'll just be

418
00:19:19,260 --> 00:19:20,200
Nero and Marie.

419
00:19:20,780 --> 00:19:21,640
I'm sure the kidnappers

420
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:22,840
are keeping an eye on them.

421
00:19:23,080 --> 00:19:24,160
Do you honestly think

422
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:24,660
it would work

423
00:19:24,660 --> 00:19:25,560
if we barge in there

424
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:26,360
without a plan?

425
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:28,440
Gosh.

426
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:29,240
Yeah?

427
00:19:30,260 --> 00:19:31,160
You got a picture

428
00:19:31,160 --> 00:19:32,600
of your little sister on you?

429
00:19:33,300 --> 00:19:33,880
What the hell

430
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:34,840
do you want it for?

431
00:19:35,280 --> 00:19:36,160
Relax, weirdo.

432
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:37,180
We needed to ask people

433
00:19:37,180 --> 00:19:38,160
if they've seen her.

434
00:19:39,520 --> 00:19:40,600
That makes sense.

435
00:19:41,380 --> 00:19:42,080
Mm-hmm.

436
00:19:45,020 --> 00:19:46,500
I need all of them back!

437
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:48,680
We don't know

438
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:50,040
what these guys might do,

439
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:52,300
so nobody go into town alone.

440
00:19:52,720 --> 00:19:54,360
Remember to watch yourselves.

441
00:19:54,980 --> 00:19:55,180
Tch.

442
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:57,260
The double-G duo rides again.

443
00:19:57,840 --> 00:19:59,280
You're not my sidekick.

444
00:19:59,740 --> 00:20:00,820
Don't be embarrassed.

445
00:20:00,980 --> 00:20:01,980
We work great together.

446
00:20:02,540 --> 00:20:03,660
Let's go, Noelle.

447
00:20:04,120 --> 00:20:04,520
Okay.

448
00:20:06,120 --> 00:20:08,060
Well, I guess it's me and you.

449
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:10,320
You got a problem with that?

450
00:20:10,460 --> 00:20:10,800
What?

451
00:20:10,940 --> 00:20:12,300
No, of course not!

452
00:20:16,680 --> 00:20:26,240
No one's come to help them?

453
00:20:26,740 --> 00:20:28,560
We only have so many forces

454
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:30,160
we can send to make repairs.

455
00:20:33,280 --> 00:20:34,420
It's strange.

456
00:20:34,780 --> 00:20:36,140
This place obviously suffered

457
00:20:36,140 --> 00:20:37,420
some serious damage.

458
00:20:37,420 --> 00:20:38,400
And yet.

459
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:56,400
Wow.

460
00:20:56,800 --> 00:20:57,180
Huh?

461
00:20:57,700 --> 00:20:58,340
I know.

462
00:20:58,600 --> 00:20:59,740
There's so many graves here,

463
00:20:59,820 --> 00:21:00,900
you can't count them all.

464
00:21:01,260 --> 00:21:02,680
Wonder how many popped up

465
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:03,860
after the big attack.

466
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:10,020
Huh?

467
00:21:10,680 --> 00:21:11,180
Huh?

468
00:21:11,180 --> 00:21:38,180
May we don't know

469
00:21:38,180 --> 00:21:39,180
No…

470
00:21:39,180 --> 00:21:40,180
No…

471
00:22:08,180 --> 00:22:14,920
掴みかけたわずかな幸福が

472
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:19,940
まだ消せない誓い叫んでる 忘れないように叫んでる

473
00:22:19,940 --> 00:22:24,900
泣きたいほど遠くたって 全然届かなくても

474
00:22:24,900 --> 00:22:29,480
信じる君は赤い手前を向いている

475
00:22:29,480 --> 00:22:36,960
だから枯れないように柄がって 描いた夢また歩き出せるきっと

476
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:40,640
僕を呼ぶ声だ

477
00:22:56,540 --> 00:23:01,240
We're getting Nero and Marie back from those jerks!

478
00:23:01,320 --> 00:23:02,160
Whatever it takes!

479
00:23:02,460 --> 00:23:04,760
Can't seem to remember what they called themselves, though.

480
00:23:05,040 --> 00:23:06,840
Let's see, it was something like...

481
00:23:06,960 --> 00:23:08,960
Devil tooth pullers!

482
00:23:08,960 --> 00:23:09,960
Banishers.

483
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:11,960
Devil injectors!

484
00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:13,960
Nope, banishers.

485
00:23:13,960 --> 00:23:15,960
Devil fourth hitters!

486
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:16,960
Banishers!

487
00:23:16,960 --> 00:23:18,960
Devil nitrate passengers!

488
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:20,960
Banishers!

489
00:23:20,960 --> 00:23:22,960
Devil news reporters!

490
00:23:22,960 --> 00:23:24,960
Banishers!

491
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:25,960
Devil book publishers!

492
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:27,960
I said banishers!

493
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:29,960
Devil banishers!

494
00:23:29,960 --> 00:23:30,960
For the left!

495
00:23:30,960 --> 00:23:32,960
Oh, you got it.

496
00:23:32,960 --> 00:23:36,960
As much as I hate to admit it,

497
00:23:36,960 --> 00:23:39,960
the kingdom desperately needs Asta's help to defeat the devil.

498
00:23:39,960 --> 00:23:42,960
Black Clover, page 144.

499
00:23:42,960 --> 00:23:44,960
Those who wish for the devil's demise.

500
00:23:44,960 --> 00:23:48,960
Someone is trying to throw the scales of justice out of balance.

